er, and was affiliated with affiliation number 3: The J. Craig Venter Institute, Rockville, Maryland, United States of America.</p><p>This author has a current address of: The Institute for Genome Sciences, University of Maryland School of Medicine, Baltimore, Maryland, United States of America.</p><p>The contributions of this author are as follows: Performed the experiments.</p></body></article>